  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed single storey front extension, by reason of its excessive depth,&amp;nbsp; bulk and massing and forward projection beyond the bay window, would poorly relate to the existing host property, detracting from the character of the adjoining terrace and properties in the surrounding area. The ground floor front extension would thereby unacceptably harm the character of the original dwellinghouse and the visual amenities and character of the area, contrary to the high quality design aspirations set out in The National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3 (D(1) and D(11)) of The London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B on the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Local Plans Policies (2013) and Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
